OL,3,GNEWSAFamily gets 'bittersweet' award
OL,4,Aafter son's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe founders of a Kent-based initiative
OL,7,Fhave described feeling "very emotional"
OL,8,Fafter receiving the highest award given
OL,9,Fto local voluntary groups in the
OL,10,Fcountry.
OL,12,FKing Charles handed the Elliott Holmes
OL,13,FMemorial Fund a King's Award for
OL,14,FVoluntary Service (KAVS) for
OL,15,Ftransforming mental health support for
OL,16,Fyoung people in Gravesham.
OL,18,FThe fund - named after a 19-year-old
OL,19,Fman who took his own life in 2020 - has
OL,20,Fhelped more than 700 teenagers access
OL,21,Fface-to-face counselling services.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
